{"id":"t20567","key":"furyo anego den inoshika o cho|1973","csv":{"title":"Furyō anego den: Inoshika o-Chō","year":1973,"directors":["Norifumi Suzuki"],"rating":4,"watchedDate":"2019-03-04"},"status":"ok","tmdb":{"tmdbId":20567,"imdbId":"tt0070085","wikidataId":"Q1475251","title":"Sex & fury","originalTitle":"不良姐御伝 猪の鹿お蝶","altTitles":["不良姐御伝 猪の鹿お蝶","sex and fury","Furyô anego den: Inoshika Ochô","Sexo e Fúria","Legend of Delinquency","不良姐御传"],"tagline":"","overview":"Petite fille, Ocho a vu son père policier se faire assassiner par des truands qui lui dérobent sa mallette. Avant de mourir, il a le temps de confier à sa fille trois cartes à jouer représentant un sanglier, un papillon et un cerf, motifs respectifs que portent en tatouage chacun des assassins. Ocho est recueillie sous la protection d'un boss bienveillant. Elle devient un pickpocket renommé dans le monde interlope mais n'oublie pas sa quête : retrouver et châtier les meurtrier de son père...","overviewLang":"fr","releaseDate":"1973-02-17","runtime":88,"status":"Released","genres":["Action","Crime"],"genreIds":[28,80],"countries":["Japan"],"originCountry":["JP"],"languages":["日本語","English"],"originalLanguage":"ja","directors":["Norifumi Suzuki"],"directorIds":[95588],"writers":["掛札昌祐","Norifumi Suzuki"],"composers":["荒木一郎"],"cinematographers":["わし尾元也"],"editors":["市田勇"],"producers":["天尾完次"],"cast":[{"id":95578,"name":"Reiko Ike","character":"Ochô Inoshika / Kyoko Kasai","profilePath":"/lYSOkdqVwj4Q6VfSWAUIDWsFlkC.jpg"},{"id":77707,"name":"Christina Lindberg","character":"Christina (as Kurisuchina Rindobaagu)","profilePath":"/1OQTOH6zgdPEYqLUSZX8Px1Gr6D.jpg"},{"id":95579,"name":"Akemi Negishi","character":"Ogin Shitateya","profilePath":"/oWE8EeeDOOMWFrgW6EPsAYdEnVZ.jpg"},{"id":95580,"name":"衣麻遼子","character":"Omiya","profilePath":"/twRe9he62QkNDcKfvUpvUL6Oy0q.jpg"},{"id":95581,"name":"Yôko Hori","character":"Okinu","profilePath":null},{"id":95582,"name":"Naomi Oka","character":"Okoi","profilePath":"/hujC