","job":"Screenplay","department":"Writing","gender":2,"profile_path":"/rlhfpgcBFPOlNPL4tif9ts3o0K4.jpg"},{"id":95588,"name":"Norifumi Suzuki","original_name":"鈴木則文","job":"Screenplay","department":"Writing","gender":2,"profile_path":"/zHiYlxbcenZP6IY0AJSqcXaZzZq.jpg"},{"id":2881950,"name":"Ichirô Horiba","original_name":"Ichirô Horiba","job":"Sound Recordist","department":"Sound","gender":0,"profile_path":null},{"id":454568,"name":"荒木一郎","original_name":"荒木一郎","job":"Original Music Composer","department":"Sound","gender":2,"profile_path":"/s2AjeG1shxMMkG9v4yhb3EFQRKy.jpg"},{"id":2844429,"name":"Yoshiyasu Ueda","original_name":"Yoshiyasu Ueda","job":"Casting","department":"Production","gender":0,"profile_path":null}]},"alternativeTitles":[{"iso_3166_1":"JP","title":"不良姐御伝 猪の鹿お蝶","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"FR","title":"sex and fury","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"JP","title":"Furyô anego den: Inoshika Ochô","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"BR","title":"Sexo e Fúria","type":"Filme"},{"iso_3166_1":"JP","title":"Legend of Delinquency","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"CN","title":"不良姐御传","type":""}],"externalIds":{"imdb_id":"tt0070085","wikidata_id":"Q1475251","facebook_id":null,"instagram_id":null,"twitter_id":null},"keywords":[{"id":417,"name":"corruption"},{"id":1664,"name":"eroticism"},{"id":9725,"name":"sword fight"},{"id":9748,"name":"revenge"},{"id":9826,"name":"murder"},{"id":10703,"name":"tragic love"},{"id":10704,"name":"female yakuza"},{"id":159551,"name":"pink film"},{"id":230462,"name":"meiji period"},{"id":325763,"name":"ambiguous"},{"id":348931,"name":"任侠"}],"releaseDates":[{"iso_3166_1":"GB","release_dates":[{"certification":"18","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"Arrow Video Blu-ray","release_date":"2026-07-06T00:00:00.000Z","type":5},{"certification":"18","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"DVD","release_date":"2006-12-14T00:00:00.000Z","type":5}]},{"iso_3166_1":"JP","release_dates":[{"certification":"","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"1973-02-17T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]},{"iso_3166_1":"NL","release_dates":[{"certification":"","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"DVD","release_date":"2007-06-08T00:00:00.000Z","type":5}]}],"translations":[{"iso_639_1":"en","iso_3166_1":"US","name":"English","english_name":"English","title":"Sex and Fury","overview":"Sex & Fury chronicles Ocho's exploits as she searches for her father's killers, each identified by unique tattoos on their backs (a deer, a boar, and a butterfly). Along the way, she also crosses paths with Shunosuke, a radical set on murdering prominent politician Kurokawa, and Christina, an American spy posing as a gambler.","tagline":"The Biography of the Woman Boss of Bad Girls..."},{"iso_639_1":"fr","iso_3166_1":"FR","name":"Français","english_name":"French","title":"Sex & fury","overview":"Petite fille, Ocho a vu son père policier se faire assassiner par des truands qui lui dérobent sa mallette. Avant de mourir, il a le temps de confier à sa fille trois cartes à jouer représentant un sanglier, un papillon et un cerf, motifs respectifs que portent en tatouage chacun des assassins. Ocho est recueillie sous la protection d'un boss bienveillant. Elle devient un pickpocket renommé dans le monde interlope mais n'oublie pas sa quête : retrouver et châtier les meurtrier de son père...","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"es","iso_3166_1":"ES","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","title":"Sex and Fury","overview":"Ochô, una muchacha de la era Meiji, presencia el asesinato de su padre, y años después lleva a cabo su venganza, teniendo tres cartas ensangrentadas como única pista para encontrar a los culpables. Ese mismo año se rodó la secuela, \"Female Yakuza Tale\".","tagline":"La biografía de la mujer jefa de las Chicas Malas..."},{"iso_639_1":"it","iso_3166_1":"IT","name":"Italiano","english_name":"Italian","title":"Sex and Japan","overview":"Sex & Fury racconta le imprese di Ocho mentre cerca gli assassini di suo padre, ciascuno identificato da tatuaggi unici sulla schiena (un cervo, un cinghiale e una farfalla). Lungo la strada, incontra anche Shonusuke, un radicale deciso a uccidere il famoso politico Kurokawa e Christina, una spia americana che si finge una giocatrice d'azzardo.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"de","iso_3166_1":"DE","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","title":"Sex and Fury","overview":"","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"hu","iso_3166_1":"HU","name":"Magyar","english_name":"Hungarian","title":"Inoshika Ocho kalandjai 2.: Szex és düh","overview":"A Meiji korszak idejében Japánban játszódó történetben, egy Ocho nevű szerencsejátékos bosszút áll három gengszteren, akik az apját ölték meg.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"sv","iso_3166_1":"SE","name":"svenska","english_name":"Swedish","title":"Sex and Fury","overview":"Ochô är en korthaj och ficktjuv i Tokyo. Efter att ha hjälpt en flyende anarkist, råkar Ochô få tag på de tre gangsters som var delaktiga i mordet på hennes far, och råkar i konflikt med japanska maffian som vill se henne död. En europeisk spion kommer in i bilden och komplicerar saker.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"nl","iso_3166_1":"NL","name":"Nederlands","english_name":"Dutch","title":"Furyô Anego Den: Inoshika Ochô","overview":"Ochô is een dievegge en gokster die zich regelmatig de woede van de plaatselijke yakuza op haar hals haalt. In haar zoektocht naar de moordenaars van haar vader, waar ze zelf getuige van was op zesjarige leeftijd, schuwt ze geen enkel middel.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ru","iso_3166_1":"RU","name":"Pусский","english_name":"Russian","title":"Секс и ярость","overview":"Отё Иносика — профессиональный карточный игрок и лучшая воровка-карманница. Скрыв у себя убегающего от погони анархиста Сюносукэ, женщина сталкивается со своим прошлым, теперь она как никогда близка к разгадке трех неизвестных личностей, ответственных за гибель её отца-полицейского. В это время в страну приезжает европейская шпионка, и ситуация осложняется. Её босс-садист имеет каверзные планы в круговороте происходящих событий. На своем пути мести Отё сражается с толпами якудза, а всё, что она знает об убийцах — это три карты с изображениями кабана, оленя и бабочки.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pt","iso_3166_1":"PT","name":"Português","english_name":"Portuguese","title":"Sexo e Fúria","overview":"Sexo e Fúria narra as façanhas de Ocho enquanto ela procura os assassinos do seu pai, cada um identificado por tatuagens únicas nas costas (um cervo, um javali e uma borboleta). Ao longo do caminho, ela também se cruza com Shonusuke, um grupo radical de assassinatos dos políticos proeminentes Kurokawa e Cristina, uma espiã americana que se apresenta como jogadora.","tagline":"A biografia da mulher chefe das meninas más..."},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"CN","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"极道大姐大传说：猪鹿蝶","overview":"明治十九年的崬 京，警官葛西德造（殿shan泰司 饰）在户外被人弄死，撕扯中从凶手身上掉出猪、鹿、蝶三张花纸牌，葛西的女儿杏子目睹了这一切。18年后杏子（池玲子 饰）以“猪鹿蝶”的外号混迹江湖，成为一名扒手，在浅草小蝶间或救助了刺杀黑川议员（河津清三郎 饰）失败的年轻人柊修之助（成濑正孝 饰）。  为探父亲死因，小蝶访问了稻村组。一名稻村组成员因违反规定被组织弄死，临终前托付小蝶赎回被卖到加纳组的妹妹小雪（早乙女莉香 饰），此举引发了小蝶和稻村组的一场大战。小蝶来至浅草，为赎回小雪决定同以黑川议员为后盾的岩仓直藏（名和宏 饰）和加纳组进行赌博。小蝶打败岩仓的女代理人Christina，通过小雪之口得知岩仓很可能就是自己的杀父仇人……","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pl","iso_3166_1":"PL","name":"Polski","english_name":"Polish","title":"Sex i Furia","overview":"Sex & Fury opisuje dzieje Ocho, które pragnie pomścić śmierć ojca i szuka jego zabójców. Każdy z nich charakteryzuje się unikalnymi tatuażami na plecach (jelenie, dzik i motyl). Po drodze spotyka też Shonusuke, radykała, który chce zamordować prominentnego polityka Kurokawę oraz Christinę, amerykańskiego szpiega, która udaje udającą zawodową hazardzistkę.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ko","iso_3166_1":"KR","name":"한국어/조선말","english_name":"Korean","title":"불량 여두목전: 이노시카 오쵸","overview":"섹스 앤 퓨리는 오초가 등에 새겨진 독특한 문신(사슴, 멧돼지, 나비)으로 확인되는 아버지의 살인자들을 찾아다니면서 오초의 위업을 기록한다. 그녀는 또한 유명한 정치인 구로카와를 살해하기 위한 급진주의자 쇼누스케와 도박꾼 행세를 하는 미국 스파이 크리스티나와 길을 건넌다.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pt","iso_3166_1":"BR","name":"Português","english_name":"Portuguese","title":"Sexo e Fúria","overview":"Era Meiji, Ocho é uma menina que presencia o assassinato do seu pai, um detetive. Anos depois, sua única meta é vingar sua morte com a única pista que tem para encontrar os culpados: três cartas ensanguentadas com figuras de animais.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"vi","iso_3166_1":"VN","name":"Tiếng Việt","english_name":"Vietnamese","title":"Cuồng Nộ Ái Tình","overview":"Trong suốt thời Minh Trị, một cô gái chuyên chơi cờ bạc săn lùng ba tay du đãng, những kẻ đã sát hại cha cô đồng thời cô cũng che dấu một người bị truy nã trong lúc đấu trí với một tay diệp viên người Anh.​","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"HK","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"猪鹿蝶","overview":"明治十九年，东京警视厅刑警葛西在幼女杏子眼前遇害，手中留下猪、鹿、蝶三张花札。约二十年后，杏子改名“猪之鹿阿蝶”，以女赌徒身份行走江湖，暗查杀父仇人。她在金泽救下行刺政界黑手黑川未遂的柊修之助，又受人所托，前往浅草赎回被卖入风月场所的少女小雪，由此与黑川的靠山岩仓直藏、以及他的女代理人克里斯蒂娜对上赌局。仇人的线索，渐渐指向那三张花札。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ja","iso_3166_1":"JP","name":"日本語","english_name":"Japanese","title":"不良姐御伝 猪の鹿お蝶","overview":"『恐怖女子高校』シリーズの池玲子とスウェーデンの人気女優・クリスチナ・リンドバーグによるエロスアクション。不良姐御が父親の仇を討つために博徒の世界に殴り込む。池玲子とクリスチナ・リンドバーグによる艶技対決は必見。時は明治38年。幼い頃に刑事だった父親を殺された葛西杏子は、犯人の手がかりである猪、鹿、蝶の絵を背中に彫り込み、女博徒・猪の鹿お蝶となって父の仇を探していく。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"sk","iso_3166_1":"SK","name":"Slovenčina","english_name":"Slovak","title":"Sex and Fury","overview":"Malé dievča je svedkom nájomnej vraždy svojho otca, ktorý bol detektívom a podarilo sa mu získať dôkazy o korupcii niektorých vysoko postavených politikov v meste. Otec jej stihol ešte dať tri malé karty so znakmi jeleňa, diviaka a motýľa – obrazce, ktoré majú jeho vrahovia vytetované na chrbte. Dievča si zmení meno na Ochô Inoshika (čo je kombinácia slov jeleň, kanec a motýľ) a dvadsať rokov po smrti otca je pripravená vydať sa na krvavú cestu pomsty.","tagline":"The Biography of the Woman Boss of Bad Girls..."}],"videos":[{"key":"YyLZF1t8M5s","site":"YouTube","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]","iso_639_1":"e